        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Southampton F.C., Tottenham Hotspur\n- People: Ronald Koeman, Mauricio Pochettino\n- Roles: manager, footballer, central defender\n- Events: 2014–15 Southampton F.C. season, managerial replacement\n\nFacts:\n- On 16 June 2014, Ronald Koeman replaced Mauricio Pochettino as Southampton F.C.'s manager for the club's 2014–15 season.\n- The 2014–15 season was Southampton F.C.'s first season under Dutch manager Ronald Koeman.\n- Mauricio Roberto Pochettino was born on 2 March 1972.\n- Mauricio Pochettino is Argentine.\n- Mauricio Pochettino is a former footballer who played as a central defender.\n- Mauricio Pochettino is the current manager of Premier League club Tottenham Hotspur.",
